# Catalog & products

- Add/edit phones only in `src/lib/products.ts`. Keep `id` and `slug` unique.
- `storage[0]` is the base price tier for `getUnitPrice` relative premiums.
- Cart/order lines identify by `productId` + `color` + `storage`.
- Every product needs `wallpaper` (`ember` | `ocean` | `mint` | `titanium` | `neon` | `sunset` | `noir`) and `imageGradient` for the stage.
- Product visuals use `PhoneVisual` (`sm` / `md` / `lg`). Cart thumbs must use `size="sm"`.
- Brand mark: `BrandLogo`. Checkout payment badges: `PaymentBrands` (stylized marks, not official trademark assets).
- Update `docs/DOMAIN_MODEL.md` when pricing rules or the Product shape change.
